A3FcvPfUEGJUeDsVhksJFtg&oe=69AADB32"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cTDYb7Ex1Q0Q7kNvwHG5xvu&_nc_oc=Adk4X0e0n61og7nIgPltHUEqvdDaCq-DmZ-79A372_FQIMCGXDzdJVza_kSHK2YE1Ak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzF7TRDnV4BZSLlfyrTiqLBU0i-Ep7WQpypTt6s6VyhNw&oe=69AAC857"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JDBXfe0cZfoQ7kNvwHH5FLj&_nc_oc=AdkuIAqkfhRP99pKSh280yfLzqpTnRIsxEuiDOxWrQFGS2v5nMfvzHETFZQ6CM5m5L0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw99tNOK4sWAb4TmnlBpvFI8puZGZJFB4YpP6OSFPusgA&oe=69AACD95"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ktHUd0X4EQQ7kNvwFj0jHg&_nc_oc=AdlJ4_nhwOa6KRRSmoDbYnHL0Q2SkHsfSE-Y8_sB1_NeJcB6emyylIloYKo7PbVhKpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzgbWKN4W8R0fPZu3NILdDsFRDZxX1P_TW4KzeQHx3LuQ&oe=69AAE142"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q-pkx0t1zWMQ7kNvwFJDUO5&_nc_oc=Adlcfmj_MwoT3Rk1gTw1rfKtaBaB79cx1aE4l08tmLDg0u93JOU0eTY9YVKn2_Zy0MU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx7C-j-kMn1iCS4ZbzDp5CLbsvNhbrrek9zuSC6Qj8HrA&oe=69AAC7C4"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B0v2QHH4N_EQ7kNvwFBkzdL&_nc_oc=Adk4pScT8HCYHFC7hfTQHv8d9CDvFoD9Q7eY6QY0QUMD_ywtil8FicnpQiRXsES6GVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzAht-RPpSPTzzNQeOtxmM030q-DyN7S9PqJhuG62sxaQ&oe=69AAC022"}, {"file